1
00:00:00,061 --> 00:00:03,521
(Past Leonard:)According to the roommate agreement,
I'm entitled to allocate 50 percent...

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,610
(Past Leonard:)...of the cubic footage
of common areas.

3
00:00:05,775 --> 00:00:09,615
(Past Sheldon:)But you didn't notify me by e-mail,
so this is still a breach.

4
00:00:10,071 --> 00:00:11,451
(Past Leonard:)I did notify you.

5
00:00:11,614 --> 00:00:13,954
(Past Sheldon:)Oh, you did, did you?

6
00:00:28,965 --> 00:00:30,845
(Past Sheldon:)Drat.

7
00:00:32,427 --> 00:00:35,467
(Past Sheldon:)Hoisted by my own spam filter.

8
00:00:35,638 --> 00:00:39,018
-What am I doing in your spam?
-I put you there after you forwarded me...

9
00:00:39,184 --> 00:00:42,184
(Past Sheldon:)...a picture of a cat playing
the piano entitled "This is funny."

10
00:00:43,688 --> 00:00:46,978
(Past Raj:)Oh, yeah. I saw that. That was hilarious.
Heh-heh-heh.

11
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:50,190
-What's this have to do with the elevator?
-I'm getting to it.

12
00:00:50,653 --> 00:00:54,363
(Past Sheldon:)I assure you, you'll be sorry
you wasted your money on an iPod...

13
00:00:54,532 --> 00:00:59,022
(Past Sheldon:)...when Microsoft comes out with theirs.

